### Summary of Deliverables in `runs/optimization_logs/phase10/p10c_material_casters/`
- **[`proposal.md`](file:///C:/Users/hoppj/SynologyDrive/01_Projets/Projet_BeamEarth/BeamNG.Earth/runs/optimization_logs/phase10/p10c_material_casters/proposal.md)** (119 lines):
  1. **Complete Streamed Mesh & Material Inventory Table**: Traces every server mesh emitter (`farfield.py`, `roads.py`, `junctions.py`, `roadmesh.py`, `plazas.py`, `airportgrade.py`, `sidewalks.py`, `furniture.py`, `buildings.py`, `seatiles.py`) to `.cdae` material names and `.materials.json` / `satmat.lua` / `roads.lua` definitions, documenting current vs. intended shadow-casting behavior.
  2. **Key Findings & Material Fixes**:
     - **Sidewalks & Curbs (`walks_<aid>_<tx>_<ty>.cdae`)**: `curbs`, `sidewalk1`, and `tactile_indicator` (`server/sidewalks.py:39`) are loaded from WCUSA's 3D shapes material file (`/levels/west_coast_usa/art/shapes/roads/main.materials.json`) where `castShadows` defaults to `true`. Because per-object shadow flags in `roads.lua:382-383` are C++ no-ops in BeamNG 0.40, every `walks` tile was submitting 3 shadow primitives across all 4 cascades. Fixed in [`roads.lua.diff`](file:///C:/Users/hoppj/SynologyDrive/01_Projets/Projet_BeamEarth/BeamNG.Earth/runs/optimization_logs/phase10/p10c_material_casters/roads.lua.diff) via `M.NO_SHADOW` in `loadMaterials()`.
     - **Opaque Road Ribbons & Markings (`road_<aid>_<tx>_<ty>.cdae`)**: Explicitly sets `castShadows = '0'` on all 10 stock road, marking, gutter, and drain materials in `roads.lua:loadMaterials()` (`M.NO_SHADOW`).
     - **Far Horizon Buildings (`bldfar_<aid>_<tx>_<ty>.cdae`, 640–1600 m)**: `far_tile()` (`server/buildings.py:2631`) previously shared `bne_bld_facade` (`castShadows: true`), causing all ~68 active `bldfar` tiles to cast shadows. Added `"bne_bld_far"` (`"castShadows": false`, `"vertColor": true`) in [`buildings.materials.json.diff`](file:///C:/Users/hoppj/SynologyDrive/01_Projets/Projet_BeamEarth/BeamNG.Earth/runs/optimization_logs/phase10/p10c_material_casters/buildings.materials.json.diff) and switched `far_tile()` / `build(..., lite=True, far=True)` in [`buildings.py.diff`](file:///C:/Users/hoppj/SynologyDrive/01_Projets/Projet_BeamEarth/BeamNG.Earth/runs/optimization_logs/phase10/p10c_material_casters/buildings.py.diff).
     - **Row-House Marble Stoops & Tunnel Interior Lamps/Soil**: Set `"castShadows": false` on `"bne_bld_marble"` (used solely for 54 cm row-house steps in `buildings.py:1107`) and on `"bne_tunnel_light"` + `"bne_tunnel_soil"` in [`tunnel.materials.json.diff`](file:///C:/Users/hoppj/SynologyDrive/01_Projets/Projet_BeamEarth/BeamNG.Earth/runs/optimization_logs/phase10/p10c_material_casters/tunnel.materials.json.diff).
     - **Adopted Satellite Materials**: Enforced `m:setField('castShadows', 0, '0')` when adopting pre-existing session materials in [`satmat.lua.diff`](file:///C:/Users/hoppj/SynologyDrive/01_Projets/Projet_BeamEarth/BeamNG.Earth/runs/optimization_logs/phase10/p10c_material_casters/satmat.lua.diff).
  3. **Building Low-LOD Vertex-Color Baking, UV Remapping & LOD Crossover ([`buildings.py.diff`](file:///C:/Users/hoppj/SynologyDrive/01_Projets/Projet_BeamEarth/BeamNG.Earth/runs/optimization_logs/phase10/p10c_material_casters/buildings.py.diff))**:
     - Remaps non-windowed triangles (roofs, plain walls, brick, stone, concrete) in `lite=True` to the solid plaster UV patch `(0.006, 0.997)` so window bands and nighttime emissives never bleed onto roofs, and bakes each material's base texture albedo (`LITE_ALBEDO`) into vertex colors `C` before collapsing to 1 primitive.
     - Raises `BLD_LOD_PX` from `2700.0` (~500 m) to `3600.0` (~360 m), shifting ~68% of the 640 m near-building disk from 13–15 primitives per tile down to **1 primitive per tile** (and **-76% vertices/triangles**, from 56,840 verts to 13,756 verts on a 180-building urban tile).
  4. **Verification ([`test_buildings.py.diff`](file:///C:/Users/hoppj/SynologyDrive/01_Projets/Projet_BeamEarth/BeamNG.Earth/runs/optimization_logs/phase10/p10c_material_casters/test_buildings.py.diff), [`verify_and_measure.py`](file:///C:/Users/hoppj/SynologyDrive/01_Projets/Projet_BeamEarth/BeamNG.Earth/runs/optimization_logs/phase10/p10c_material_casters/verify_and_measure.py))**:
     - Validated all 5 `*.materials.json` files, passed all 56 unit tests in `test_buildings.py`, and verified all 6 `.diff` patches with `git apply --check`.
